<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<odoo>

    <!-- Thirty-two bookings across the scenario matrix of spec §18: every one of the eight
         booking states, single-hall and multi-hall, past and future, each pricelist family,
         and same-day pairs in DIFFERENT halls (which is the only same-day pairing the 4h
         preparation and 5h cleanup buffers allow).

         No record here overlaps another on the same hall. Conflicts are exercised in
         tests/, never shipped as data — CON-01 would refuse them and the addon would fail
         to install, which is exactly the guarantee this file relies on.

         The nine bookings that are completed, ready or imminent carry a filled
         operational appendix, so RPT-04 and RPT-08 print with real content.

         ⚠ Every order_line list starts with (5, 0, 0). These files are deliberately not
         noupdate, so `-u` re-applies them — and a (0, 0, {...}) command CREATES a line every
         time it runs. Without the clear, each upgrade silently appended a second copy of
         every hall line (measured: 220 lines became 264 on one upgrade).
    -->

